    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 11,
    "title": "Describe a topic and its properties",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-topics-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe a topic and its properties",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "An entity can be the topic of a comment without a passive marker. A subject-predicate phrase can describe a topic or modify a noun; keep its internal subject and predicate together. A noun phrase can predicate a quantity or date without 是, such as a person’s age. This is a bounded pattern, not permission to omit 是 from all identity clauses. An affected entity can also be the subject of a completed-action predicate without a passive marker; this differs from moving an object before an overt agent.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书我看过。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū wǒ kàn guo 。",
                "meaning": "I have read this book.",
                "audio": "0599f23411e406838156dd38679792f8ba6bb32746e03dd80bd95f6072271134"
              },
              {
                "text": "他身体很好。",
                "pinyin": "tā shēntǐ hěn hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "His health is very good.",
                "audio": "d216b56818e392ba9bc57b4684f6b122f6c663a4dd16433f46b2ed19514e1127"
              },
              {
                "text": "我买的书很好。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi de shū hěn hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "The book I bought is good.",
                "audio": "dbbc7677eef40ee01f440794ee150a763a169d336daf5778a583751a536923fc"
              },
              {
                "text": "他二十岁。",
                "pinyin": "tā èr shí suì 。",
                "meaning": "He is twenty years old.",
                "audio": "137730787f3dcab90d8e90864abab241f9fbc8dcfb7d4bd16c11db6afbfd3b02"
              },
              {
                "text": "门关了。",
                "pinyin": "mén guān le 。",
                "meaning": "The door has been closed; the person who closed it is not stated.",
                "audio": "37e38438ad038f0617721232ff4b0789c56df4def54715bc07c983520407b170"
              }
            ]
          },
